==History==
2021 
*The Skeleton King [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 27/10/2021, in the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]].
*On 4/11/2021, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(4/11/2021)|maintenance break]], increased his damage by 14%, area radius to 1.3 tiles (from 1 tile), and gave him knockback immunity.
2022
*On 30/3/2022, the [[Version History#Miner%20Update%20(30/3/2022)|Miner Update]], fixed an issue where [[Clone|cloning]] Skeleton King during the Soul Summoning animation would cancel it. It also fixed a stats rounding issue with the Skeleton King's summoned [[Skeletons]].
*On 7/6/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/6/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Skeletons spawned by Soul Summoning to 18 (from 20).
*On 2/8/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(2/8/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Skeletons spawned by Soul Summoning to 16 (from 18).
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Skeleton King from [[Training Camp]] to Executioner's Kitchen. This also made it so that players at any [[Experience|King Level]] could unlock the Skeleton King, as opposed to only Level 14. There was also an unannounced change to the Skeleton King, a decrease to his collision radius to 1 tile (from 1.2 tiles).
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], decreased the Skeleton King's hitpoints by 0.08% and his damage by 0.48%.
2025
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] increased the Skeleton's attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.0 seconds).
*On 24/10/25,  a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (4/11/2021)|maintenance break]], decreased Soul Summoning’s skeleton spawn radius to 3.5 tiles (from 4 tiles).

